WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.246
Kusheh en welkom to di payroll voucher deep-dive.

2
00:00:03.246 --> 00:00:08.994
Before SaloneHCM, branch dem been de email spreadsheet or carry paper voucher go headquarters.

3
00:00:08.994 --> 00:00:17.738
Now, every branch de submit into one central digital repository, en every voucher de pass one strict approval chain before even one leone move.

4
00:00:17.738 --> 00:00:19.450
Mek wi waka di full journey.

5
00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:32.374
Dis na di central repository. Di indicator card dem de show aw much branch don submit dis period, wetin de wait supervisor sign-off, wetin de na finance review, en wetin don authorize for payment.

6
00:00:32.374 --> 00:00:36.642
Di filter dem mek yu able slice by period, branch, en workflow stage.

7
00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:19.542
Open any voucher en yu go see di full story: every employee line with gross pay, P A Y E, NASSIT, loan deduction en net pay; di total dem; en di complete audit timeline — who create am, who approve am, en exactly when.

8
00:01:19.542 --> 00:01:21.798
Once e submit, di voucher don freeze.

9
00:01:21.798 --> 00:01:24.298
Nobody no able quietly change any number.

10
00:01:26.250 --> 00:01:28.826
Di workflow de enforce four eyes minimum.

11
00:01:28.826 --> 00:01:32.093
Branch officer submit. Di branch supervisor approve.

12
00:01:32.093 --> 00:01:39.758
Finance officer review en approve — en di system de physically block anybody from approve voucher wey den den self create.

13
00:01:39.758 --> 00:01:48.366
Finally one Ministry of Finance approver de authorize payment — en dat person must different from both di creator en di finance approver.

14
00:01:48.366 --> 00:01:51.570
Dual control, wey software de enforce, no be trust.

15
00:01:52.250 --> 00:02:00.950
Mistake de happen. Instead of edit in place, reviewer de return di voucher with written reason — at least ten character, e de always record.

16
00:02:00.950 --> 00:02:05.363
Di branch correct di figure dem, resubmit, en di revision number go up.

17
00:02:05.363 --> 00:02:07.538
Di correction history de permanent.

18
00:02:09.250 --> 00:02:14.517
En di quiet protection dem: one voucher per branch per period — duplicate de reject.

19
00:02:14.517 --> 00:02:20.035
One employee no able show na two voucher for di same month — dat na di double-pay guard.

20
00:02:20.035 --> 00:02:24.424
En once payment authorize, di voucher turn permanent immutable record.

21
00:02:24.424 --> 00:02:27.058
Na so payroll fraud loophole dem de close.

22
00:02:28.250 --> 00:02:33.340
Submit digital, approve na chain, return with reason, en mek di rails do den work.

23
00:02:33.340 --> 00:02:37.250
Di voucher certification quiz de wait yu na di Training Center.
